{"version":1,"content":"<p>視后楊茜堯、林夏薇、視帝陳豪、馬國明及陳展鵬等主演的無綫重量級台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》，揭露娛樂圈的爾虞我詐，每個角色都各有黑暗面，加上以復仇劇作包裝，勢必成為全城熱話。</p><p>楊茜堯於大結局挑大樑演出一鏡到底、長達7分鐘的情喊戲，展示視后級演技。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.624519+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T10:40:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"afeea185e48cde2eebd797adc8a28019ec7e71b96c5accee7d7338900deb133b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}